      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشِيجَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>root</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْق</span>) <i>of a tree.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَاشِجَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشِيجَةٌ</span> [<i>An implement made of</i>]
<i>fibres of the palm tree</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ليف</span>) <i>twisted, and then
